			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿贝多"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 110440141,
					"content": "我回来了，你们看到什么有意思的东西了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440142,
						110440144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440142,
					"content": "都看不懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440143,
					"content": "没关系，只是一些炼金术的常用物件而已，生活中不太会用到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440146,
					"content": "总之，抓紧时间进行下一项研究吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440101
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440101,
					"content": "不同的世界之间，可能存在非常大的差异。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440102,
					"content": "打个比方来说，在提瓦特，拥有神之眼的人就可以使用元素力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440103,
					"content": "但也可能存在「只有一人可以使用元素力的世界」，又或者「每个人都能使用元素力的世界」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440104,
					"content": "#所以，{NICKNAME}，除了元素之外…你是否还掌握一些，这个世界没有的特殊力量呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440105,
					"content": "还是只能用之前的办法，用实验来测定了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440106,
						110440107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440106,
					"content": "又要打史莱姆吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440108,
					"content": "不不不，这次就不费什么周折了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440109,
					"content": "这边有根柱子，你试试看用意志力将它折断吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440110,
						110440113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440110,
					"content": "抱歉，我做不到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440111,
					"content": "已经认真地尝试过了吗？是吗…唔，没关系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440112,
					"content": "这才是正常的吧，怎么觉得你有点失望的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440116,
					"content": "对了，你有尝试过用元素力做菜吗？不是说烹饪，而是把元素力放进菜里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440117,
					"content": "我很好奇菜会不会因此变得更好吃，或者改变口感，甚至是…增殖？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440118,
						110440119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440118,
					"content": "炼金术士的想法真是独特。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440120,
					"content": "哈哈，好奇心放在平时别人不会注意的地方，更容易发现惊喜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440121,
					"content": "那么，拜托你们去做一道「黄油煎鱼」吧，这里是我刚刚准备的食谱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440151,
					"content": "还以为你是去准备奇奇怪怪的东西，原来是食谱啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440122,
					"content": "因为平时我也经常吃这个，无论是做实验还是品尝，它都是很好的选择。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440123,
					"content": "你肯定是饿了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440124,
					"content": "不过如果要做好吃的，我是不会反对的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440125,
						110440126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440125,
					"content": "好好好，明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440127,
					"content": "嗯嗯，这就是好伙伴的默契！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440128,
					"content": "那就交给你们了，我很期待实验结果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440130,
					"content": "如果真的出现我们吃不完的情况，还可以请蒂玛乌斯一起来分享。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440131,
					"content": "有我在，不用担心这种事啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440126,
					"content": "不会忘记你的那一份的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440119,
					"content": "你不会只是因为饿了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440113,
					"content": "折断它吧，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440114,
					"content": "无论是你还是我都做不到啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440115,
					"content": "已经认真地尝试过了吗？是吗…唔，没关系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 110440107,
					"content": "又要喝药吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440144,
					"content": "有点乱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110440145,
					"content": "嗯，同感，我也正想找个时间收拾一下，不过实验一个接一个…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110440146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1104403,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1104403
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
